CORE
parameter2.sv
--bound 2
^\[main\.u\.p0\] always \$bits\(main\.u\.s\.a\) == 4: PROVED up to bound 2$
^\[main\.p1\] always main\.i\.b == 4'b1111: PROVED up to bound 2$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
The interface instantiated under an interface port must have the parameters
of the interface instance that is bound to the port.
